---
import Window from "../ui/Window.astro";
---

<section id="about">
    <Window title="about.txt">
        <div class="content">
            <p>
                I like owning a feature end to end: design, code, deployment and
                monitoring. I have worked mostly in TypeScript but I'm
                comfortable adapting to different languages and technologies. I
                like understanding how things work before jumping into
                implementation, exploring different approaches, and finding the
                right balance between simplicity, efficiency, and
                maintainability. I'm always looking for ways to improve things,
                even when they already work.
            </p>

            <p>
                At PixBet I led the backend and cloud infrastructure for an
                iGaming platform from conception to production. In 2025 I joined
                Devoteam to work on a Critical TechWorks project, developing
                in-vehicle software for BMW and Rolls-Royce.
            </p>

            <p>
                I'm curious by nature, which extends well beyond software. I
                enjoy tinkering with computers and contributing to open source,
                but I also like getting away from a screen to work on my car or
                play bass. I love spending time outdoors, whether it's rock
                climbing or spending a day fishing, and I'm always up for trying
                out new things.
            </p>
        </div>
    </Window>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .content {
        display: flow-root;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
        background-color: var(--panel);
        color: var(--border);

        p {
            margin-block: 0.8rem;
        }
    }
</style>
